                  <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>">bg--black</code> and no shade in between: those two
                  are the only solid fills on 1-bit, and small text over a dither tile is unreadable. Its edge comes from
                  <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>">outline</code>, which reads against a light and a dark
                  map alike, and never from a box-shadow, which ePaper renders as a smear of dither.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

